cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, please cite it."
title: "dart-dmp-template: a short data management plan template for projects at IT:U"
abstract: >-
  A page for writing a data management plan for a project at IT:U: the project,
  its datasets and the fifteen questions of Science Europe's core requirements.
  The plan is downloaded as a document, in the sections of the Horizon Europe
  template or in Science Europe's, and as dmp.json in the RDA DMP Common
  Standard v1.2, with IT:U recorded as the affiliation of the contact. It is a
  draft prepared by DART and has not been adopted as IT:U policy. Built on
  Actionable DMP.
